# OpenTofu / Terraform local state and working files.
# State is local-only for now (see README) and must never be committed:
# it can contain repository IDs and other data we don't want tracked in git,
# and committing it would conflict with anyone else running tofu locally.
#
# .terraform.lock.hcl is NOT ignored — commit it, it pins provider checksums.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Variable files can carry secrets; only *.tfvars.example is safe to commit.
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
!*.tfvars.json.example

# Plan output files (may embed state/secret values). *.plan covers
# `-out=name.plan`, which doesn't match the more common *.tfplan.
*.tfplan
*.plan
